  <ifrs:ExplanationOfNatureAndAmountOfChangesInEstimatesOfAmountsReportedInPriorInterimPeriodsOrPriorFinancialYears contextRef="id20">NA</ifrs:ExplanationOfNatureAndAmountOfChangesInEstimatesOfAmountsReportedInPriorInterimPeriodsOrPriorFinancialYears>
